{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "b52b9c1cf95698140f04aea28ee0c0832993d7469bc632715d226e66e21e4f1b", "ja": "だから、こっちが山口でこれが山田、そっちが浜田よ！\nなんでこれくらいのことが覚えられないのかしら。", "zh": "就说了这是山口，这是山田，然后那位是滨田啦！\n为什么连这点小事都记不起来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1001_p", "source_sha256": "edf77ba82a09e8ad51deb0848b761119d57595bf96dd11986f9dc55cf467459d", "ja": "いや……逆になんで伊織は、こんなよく似たおじさんの\n写真を全部覚えられるんだ……？", "zh": "呃……我才想问伊织为什么能把这些\n长相差不多的大叔照片全都记起来啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "bc308380eb60967a11831d437c21ba064f9793d1c43e950bbf2b4d9f5591bdd6", "ja": "出席者の顔と名前の暗記なんて、常識よ？\n何が次に繋がるかわからないんだし。", "zh": "把参加者的脸和名字记起来可是常识喔～\n毕竟不知道什么人会把机会带来给我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "79759199e72de804a9bb42ed6a09230e73a65dee0e3c24d8a8b0464f6470bdea", "ja": "はい、次。それは？", "zh": "好啦，下一张。这位是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d3cbf4d02564c601fbcd1caa2e7d6f65531336ec4460bcf5de8f87738384ed8e", "ja": "や……、浜口……山。", "zh": "山……滨口……山。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "8b82fd1fcf1b46c546fffc3bac4071845714bd603a2874c57da51cc7b965539a", "ja": "山口だって言ってるでしょ！？　はぁ……これじゃ\nパーティー当日は、いつもと逆になりそうね。", "zh": "就跟你说是山口了啦！唉……照这样下去，\n到了派对当天，感觉会跟平常反过来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1006_p", "source_sha256": "226d4750daf2707b52e43edb8f5494e7b0dc346c8528d07dcc1919604f5a37c2", "ja": "いつもと逆？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "跟平常反过来？什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "bd12e1f63d870d15b05a16a823427191a1545e95741169f612169b2ed62f8260", "ja": "この私が、あんたに付きっ切りになってあげるって\n言ってるの！　でないと私が落ち着かないもの。", "zh": "意思就是本小姐会随时跟在你身边！\n不然我也静不下心来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0022_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "d941c3fc71a781126177fb21fe73881926f9650afe670d36b6326f49ed59bd4f", "ja": "情けないと思うなら、ちゃんと覚えなさいよね♪\nほら、次の写真、いくわよ！", "zh": "如果觉得这样很逊的话，就好好记住吧♪\n好啦，换下一张照片啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
